To add items:
-Add to src/main/java/name/lapidary/item/ModItems.java and ModCreativeTabs.java
  This is where you add unusual properties, like
  stack sizes or durability
-Add .png texture to src/main/resources/assets/lapidary/textures/item/
-Add model to src/main/resources/assets/lapidary/models/item/
  Normal items use "minecraft:item/generated" and "lapidary:item/polished_sea_glass"
  Tool items use "minecraft:item/handheld" and "lapidary:item/example_tool"
-Add display name to src/main/resources/assets/lapidary/lang/en_us.json

To add blocks:
-Add to src/main/java/name/lapidary/block/ModBlocks.java
-Add .png texture to src/main/resources/assets/lapidary/textures/block/
-Add model to src/main/resources/assets/lapidary/models/block/
-Add blockstate to src/main/resources/assets/lapidary/blockstates/
-Add inventory model to src/main/resources/assets/lapidary/models/item/
-Add display name to src/main/resources/assets/lapidary/lang/en_us.json
-Add loot table to src/main/resources/data/lapidary/loot_table/blocks/

To add recipes:
-Add to src\main\resources\data\lapidary\recipe